flowchart LR
    A([Prompt]) --> B[Tokenize and<br/>run model]
    B --> C[Next-token<br/>logits]
    C --> D[Constraint:<br/>valid token IDs]
    D --> E[Mask logits<br/>and sample]
    E --> F[Append and<br/>advance state]
    F --> G{Complete<br/>or EOS?}
    G -- no --> H[Forward pass<br/>with KV cache]
    H --> C
    G -- yes --> I([Return text])
